    "description": "D-027: a line discount larger than the line was capped. States BOTH figures -- what was entered and what was actually deducted -- because a message that only said some discount was ignored leaves the user unable to tell which line or by how much. Almost always a data-entry slip, so it is surfaced as a question rather than absorbed.",
